title: 'YAP runtime: enable local dev mode and tune elastic scaling parameters'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Update the YAP testing runtime to make local development easier.

      - Adds a `dev` cargo feature that sets `RELAY_PARENT_OFFSET = 0` so the
        runtime can be run locally with `polkadot-omni-node --dev` without a
        live relay chain.
      - Support 12 cores / 500ms blocks.
      - Add README
      - Bumps `spec_version` to `1_003_002`.

crates:
  - name: yet-another-parachain-runtime
    bump: patch
